      "comment": "Traupman’s word for a timetable of trains, buses and flights (<span lang=\"la\">hōrārium autoraedārum longārum</span>, the bus timetable). In Lewis &amp; Short <span lang=\"la\">hōrārium</span> is only a late word for a clock (Censorinus); the timetable is a modern sense."
